job-name-judicial-inspector = Judicial Inspector
job-description-judicial-inspector = Head of the local internal tribunal division, responsible for enforcing local regulations and standard operating procedures. In exceptional circumstances, and with RAF authorization, conducts court hearings. CLASS A
job-name-tribunal-officer = Tribunal Officer
job-description-tribunal-officer = Tribunal service officer, the eyes and ears of the RAF. Monitors facility personnel and reports their violations to their supervisors, Site security, and the judicial inspector. CLASS B
job-supervisors-internal-tribunal-service = internal tribunal service
job-supervisors-judicial-inspector = judicial inspector
